#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_1_title"
msgid "How can I change the widgets color?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_1_text"
msgid ""
"In case you have only 1 active widget, you can either recreate it, or use "
"the button in the app settings for customizing it. If you have multiple "
"active widgets, the button in the app settings will not be available. As the "
"app supports color customization per-widget, you will have to recreate the "
"widget that you want to customize."
msgstr ""
